> WhatsApp</a><a class="mail"><span class="social-icon mail-icon">✉</span> Email</a><a class="pin" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="social-icon pin-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-3.65 19.31c-.04-.8-.01-1.77.2-2.63l1.28-5.43s-.32-.64-.32-1.59c0-1.49.86-2.6 1.94-2.6.92 0 1.36.69 1.36 1.51 0 .92-.59 2.29-.89 3.56-.25 1.06.53 1.92 1.57 1.92 1.88 0 3.33-1.98 3.33-4.83 0-2.52-1.81-4.28-4.4-4.28-3.01 0-4.78 2.26-4.78 4.59 0 .91.35 1.89.79 2.42.09.11.1.2.07.31l-.29 1.18c-.05.19-.16.23-.36.14-1.35-.63-2.19-2.61-2.19-4.2 0-3.42 2.48-6.56 7.16-6.56 3.76 0 6.68 2.68 6.68 6.26 0 3.74-2.36 6.75-5.63 6.75-1.1 0-2.13-.57-2.48-1.14l-.67 2.55c-.24.93-.89 2.1-1.33 2.89A10 10 0 1 0 12 2Z"/></svg></span> Pinterest</a><a class="tw" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="social-icon">𝕏</span> X</a></div></details></div><p class="intro">{sections[0][1]}</p></section><div class="content"><img class="lead-image" src={a.image} alt={en?'Illustrative editorial photograph':'Fotografía editorial ilustrativa'} /><article class="article-text">{sections.map(s=><section><h2>{s[0]}</h2><p>{s[1]}</p></section>)}<p class="disclaimer">{en?'Editorial draft for design review. General information only; not a substitute for individualized veterinary advice.':'Borrador editorial para revisar el diseño. Información general; no reemplaza el asesoramiento veterinario individual.'}</p></article><section class="related"><h2>{en?'Related nutrition articles':'Artículos relacionados de alimentación'}</h2><div class="related-grid">{related.map(r=><a class="related-card" href={'/'+lang+'/nutrition/'+r.slug+'/'}><img src={r.image} alt="" loading="lazy"/><strong>{en?r.en:r.es}</strong><span>{en?'Read article →':'Leer artículo →'}</span></a>)}</div></section></div></main><footer><strong>BULLDOGFRANCES.COM</strong><nav><a href={'/'+lang+'/'}>{en?'Home':'Inicio'}</a><a href={'/'+lang+'/nutrition/'}>{en?'Nutrition':'Alimentación'}</a><a href={'